Package: FibrTraQ
Type: Package
Title: Voxel-Resolved Focal-ROI Target Profiling of Diffusion Tractograms
Version: 0.3.2.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chase", "Stratton", , "cstratton@desu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nicholas", "Cottam", role = "aut")
  )
Author: Chase Stratton [aut, cre], Nicholas Cottam [aut]
Description: Tools to compute orientation-invariant focal-voxel by target-ROI
    association profiles from diffusion tractography. Implements the FibrTraQ
    workflow and utilities for ROI coordinate extraction,
    focal-voxel/streamline association counting, selectable full-streamline,
    endpoint-voxel, and scanner-space local-search target assignment, additive
    focal-target endpoint-pair and target-penetration audits, endpoint
    anatomical-context quality control, ROI-level unique-streamline summaries,
    and RSC summaries defined over focal voxels.
